@startuml
!include style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

skinparam stateBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam stateBorderColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam stateFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR

state "L1 roster: {S1, S2}\nNo attendance for 2026-10-05" as Unrecorded
state "L1 roster: {S1, S2}\nS1 = present, S2 = absent" as Recorded
state "L1 roster: {S1, S2}\nS1 = absent, S2 = absent" as Corrected
state "L1 roster: {S2}\nS1 = absent (former), S2 = absent" as Retained
state "L1 roster: {S2}\nS2 = absent" as Removed

note as ExampleNotes
  Worked example notes:
  • Setup: add L1, then enrol S1 and S2.
  • Each status uses its own Student ID + Lesson ID + date key.
  • Unenrolment changes only L1's roster; S1's dated key remains.
  • The example ends after unmark; later commands remain possible.
end note

[*] --> Unrecorded
Unrecorded --> Recorded : mark each Student
Recorded --> Corrected : mark S1 absent\n(same dated key)
Corrected --> Retained : unenrol S1
Retained --> Removed : unmark S1

@enduml
